{"title":"Basilisk Feet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 31)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 31 <span class=\"muted\">(844 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/gold-bar\">Gold Bar</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/basilisk-scale\">Basilisk Scale</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/693cdcd1354d2d8ef957.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/basilisk-scale\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/13dd8a76abe6f934af77.svg\" alt=\"\">Basilisk Scale</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/2382b5fc3175200d957a.svg\" alt=\"Basilisk Feet\"></div><h3>Basilisk Feet</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Armor Smithing 31</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}